  "open": [
    "HTTP status when the same receipt_id is PUT with a different body. OpenAPI signReceipt lists 200 and 404 only. ACP still freezes the body and refuses a second receipt_id.",
    "GET 404 E_RECEIPT_NOT_FOUND after a timeout means the receipt was not stored, so the same receipt_id may be PUT again with the frozen body. That branch is specified and is not this timeout fixture, which is the accepted branch.",
    "Percent values are not in OpenAPI 1.2.6. This file maps only 20.00 gross to STANDARD.",
    "SignedReceiptSchema requires schema.raw on a 200. ReceiptResponse also requires fon_validations. NORMAL and CANCELLATION fixtures use an empty array because the OpenAPI text limits FON validation to INITIALIZATION, YEARLY_CLOSE, and DECOMMISSION."
  ]
